22110","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122110","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122110.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122110.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-11T16:46:20Z"},"body":"- Follow-up to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122109 (best merged after that PR).\r\n\r\nThis matches the behavior seen on native platforms.\r\n\r\nWhen merged after https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2661, this in turn removes the need for fallback code for any platform, since all platforms now support automatic display scaling according to OS settings.\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n### Desktop\r\n\r\n*Firefox 153 on Fedora 44 (X11).*\r\n\r\n<img width=\"532\" height=\"382\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/984b3b10-e17e-49b8-85a6-15dfdb63890f\" />\r\n\r\n### Mobile\r\n\r\n*Firefox 153 on Android 16 on a Samsung Galaxy S26 Ultra (1080p resolution, minimum width set to 449 dp in the developer options).*\r\n\r\n<img width=\"521\" height=\"448\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260805_014752_Firefox\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/98912490-8234-4c7d-b30c-e6938ddee40b\" />\r\n\r\nBy the way, I didn't find an easy way to host an HTTPS-enabled web server for local testing of the web editor on a mobile device (HTTPS is required for the secure context). I ended up using this: https://github.com/TheWaWaR/simple-http-server/issues/86#issuecomment-5185848324\r\n\r\nMaybe we should make `platform/web/serve.py` able to host with HTTPS and a self-signed certificate?","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122110/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122110/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}